# Copy values into user-secrets or environment variables — never commit real keys.
#
# Default with no configuration: Ai__Provider=Lexical
#   Offline bag-of-words retrieval. No API key, no network, no cost.
#   Security and grounding behaviour is identical to the hosted providers —
#   only answer fluency differs.
#
# Production (VPS): set these in /opt/apps/env/contoso.env (chmod 600).
# Never put a key in this file, compose, or git.
#
# Spend cap: set a monthly budget in the OpenAI dashboard
#   (Settings → Limits) BEFORE the key is live. The in-app daily ceiling
#   is a second brake, not a substitute.

# --- OpenAI (preferred for this demo — clients already exist) -----------------
# Ai__Provider=OpenAI
# Ai__OpenAI__ApiKey=
# Ai__OpenAI__ChatModel=gpt-4o-mini
# Ai__OpenAI__EmbeddingModel=text-embedding-3-small
# OPENAI_API_KEY=

# --- Cost controls (config, not constants) ------------------------------------
# Ai__DailyRequestCeiling=10
# Ai__PerIpLimit=10
# Ai__PerIpWindowMinutes=15

# --- Azure OpenAI (needs a subscription + deployed models) --------------------
# Ai__Provider=AzureOpenAI
# Ai__AzureOpenAI__Endpoint=https://YOUR_RESOURCE.openai.azure.com/
# Ai__AzureOpenAI__ApiKey=
# Ai__AzureOpenAI__ChatDeployment=gpt-4o-mini
# Ai__AzureOpenAI__EmbeddingDeployment=text-embedding-3-small

# --- Auth ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# Required in any deployed environment. 32+ characters.
# Jwt__Key=
